Runtime fault [R0802]: use of storage after its lifetime ended in `pointer is used only after arena reset to prove quarantine`
 --> examples/features/memory/unsafe_sentries.jet:7, in #Unsafe gate examples/features/memory/unsafe_sentries.jet:7
 Why: the storage was released or its owning Jet frame expired before this read (the address belongs to quarantined storage)
 Fix: do not use the pointer after release or frame exit — obligation `valid_ptr` was not met on this run
